stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending
  Pending --> Uploading: start
  Uploading --> Processing: received
  Processing --> Ready: processed
  Uploading --> Failed: error
  Processing --> Failed: error
  Failed --> Uploading: retry [attempts < 3]
  Pending --> Canceled: cancel
  Uploading --> Canceled: cancel
  Failed --> Canceled: cancel
  Ready --> [*]
  Canceled --> [*]
